Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.76,0:01:34.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远在一起！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.45,0:01:39.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕 大谷明天就要考试了 我怎么也静不下来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.41,0:01:40.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发个加油的短信好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.56,0:01:42.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有邮件
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:46.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(大谷:救救我)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.78,0:01:48.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.36,0:01:54.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这附近的人我都找遍了 没一个能帮得上忙的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:56.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请进
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:01:57.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扰了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.93,0:01:59.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 干嘛这么客气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.74,0:02:00.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是客不客气的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:02.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道啦知道啦 快进来快进来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.57,0:02:08.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是你的男朋友？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:09.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.96,0:02:10.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.47,0:02:12.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 我能问你个问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.16,0:02:14.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身高以外的问题都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.51,0:02:15.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不介意嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.47,0:02:17.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真啰嗦 一边去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.08,0:02:19.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 有客人来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.92,0:02:21.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 这就是我刚刚说的…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.10,0:02:26.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊呀啊呀啊呀 孩子他爸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.05,0:02:29.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下 不用连老爸也叫来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:32.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 原来在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.57,0:02:33.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓了一跳
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.39,0:02:40.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,初次见面 我 我是小泉 不 理莎的男朋友 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.85,0:02:43.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办爸爸 我今天什么都没准备
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.09,0:02:43.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请别客气
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.66,0:02:46.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身高…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.11,0:02:49.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,156公分 不好意思 矮了点 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.09,0:02:52.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 你觉得这个大高个合适吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.41,0:02:52.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么大高个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.48,0:02:55.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 今天冒昧来访 真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.15,0:02:58.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请让我留住一宿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.34,0:02:59.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:01.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 让我来解释一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.15,0:03:04.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是那样的 我没有别的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.15,0:03:09.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实大谷明天要考试 但他全家都染上了流行性感冒
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:10.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是如此 所以 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:12.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的没有别的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.30,0:03:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.99,0:03:16.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他睡在哪里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.75,0:03:20.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的房间 哦不 我睡别的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:21.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:23.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.77,0:03:25.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:27.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 累坏了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.89,0:03:30.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 嗯 一点而已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.39,0:03:34.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不是很奇怪 我在干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.28,0:03:37.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偏偏在考试前发生这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.77,0:03:38.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.23,0:03:46.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 等考完了一定再重新登门拜访
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.89,0:03:53.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样子 他们肯定会认为我是不顾考试只会跟女朋友厮混的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.39,0:03:55.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经解释过了 没事的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:57.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我讨厌这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.13,0:03:59.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也不用这么较劲嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.62,0:04:02.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么时候都很认真的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.85,0:04:04.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最讨厌半途而废了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.51,0:04:09.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛这样啊 与其介意这件事 还是多想想明天的考试吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.27,0:04:09.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的有理
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.43,0:04:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好复习吧 我去弟弟的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.23,0:04:16.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诶 这样好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:19.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在一起肯定会聊得没完没了的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.35,0:04:20.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想打搅你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.23,0:04:21.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.18,0:04:24.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么需要随时叫我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.37,0:04:27.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 那你加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:32.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 开工了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.64,0:04:37.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是呀 大谷没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.83,0:04:40.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算在考试前一天被赶出家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.82,0:04:42.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还莫名其妙地拜访了我的家人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:45.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没什么好担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.88,0:04:50.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打扰了 要来点夜宵嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.15,0:04:58.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办 要叫醒他吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.16,0:05:03.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是让他多睡会儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:15.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睫毛真长啊 好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:24.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天要加油哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.35,0:05:40.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（oh no）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.91,0:05:43.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.98,0:05:45.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷快起来 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.67,0:05:46.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几点考试啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:49.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,9点 20分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.97,0:05:51.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经8点多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.39,0:05:56.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到考场要多长时间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:05:58.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乘电车大约一个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.18,0:05:59.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许还赶得上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.89,0:06:01.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,东西别忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.80,0:06:03.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么不叫醒我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.27,0:06:04.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么但是 什么都别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.88,0:06:16.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.80,0:06:19.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么状况
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.52,0:06:20.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雪 怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:24.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电车和公车都停运了 刚刚电视上说的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:27.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办啊 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:29.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.82,0:06:31.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.86,0:06:36.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从我昨天被赶出家门的那一刻 我的人生就脱轨了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.27,0:06:38.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这场雪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.07,0:06:43.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吓了我一跳 下得这么大
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:45.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道会积多高
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:54.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.09,0:06:55.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:07:01.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这场雪是下在每个考生头上的 又不是你一个人受灾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:04.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么丧气话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.57,0:07:06.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,站起来 站起来大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.46,0:07:06.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我正站着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:08.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个敢说敢做的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.77,0:07:09.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.45,0:07:11.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有说丧气话的工夫还不如抓紧赶过去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.04,0:07:13.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:13.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.20,0:07:14.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.80,0:07:18.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.06,0:07:21.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是电车已经停了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.45,0:07:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就去乘地铁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.65,0:07:26.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是别勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.15,0:07:29.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别乱来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:30.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上西天的话只能说抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.08,0:07:31.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放我下来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.07,0:07:36.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷你这么努力地学习 我不希望你的努力白费
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.99,0:07:40.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管考上考不上 尽力就好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:42.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要让你之前的努力白费
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.96,0:07:43.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:46.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自行车禁止载人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.98,0:07:49.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地铁到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.62,0:07:55.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天考试结束时 我要微笑着对你说：辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.95,0:08:00.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（理莎：还有5分钟）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.35,0:08:03.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（大谷：我连小时候的记忆 都全部消失了）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:06.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（理莎：走好）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.45,0:08:06.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（大谷：好）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.12,0:08:10.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.98,0:08:13.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Fight
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.61,0:08:17.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫那么响干嘛 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.73,0:08:20.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你绝对没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.58,0:08:23.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 考试正式开始
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.09,0:08:31.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,未来志愿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.51,0:08:32.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.17,0:08:35.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又见面了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.12,0:08:40.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考试结果要在一周后出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.17,0:08:43.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之我们从漫长的备考中解放出来喽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.89,0:08:46.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好久没出来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去哪里 看点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.47,0:08:50.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便随便 去哪都好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:52.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天是小泉的感恩日
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.59,0:08:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.69,0:08:56.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我备考的时候你哪里都没去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以今天你说怎样就怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:00.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的假的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:07.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 敦敦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.28,0:09:11.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:12.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.95,0:09:14.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大婶你怎么也在
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:14.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.21,0:09:17.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么啊 打扮成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.19,0:09:18.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:19.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,工作？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杂志摄影
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为美美是个超级模特
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.44,0:09:25.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 对哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.70,0:09:27.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天是户外摄影
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.04,0:09:31.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诶 第一次看到别人摄影呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.99,0:09:33.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.37,0:09:36.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好冷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.37,0:09:37.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.24,0:09:39.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没问题吧 会感冒的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.29,0:09:40.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.28,0:09:43.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是专业级的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.76,0:09:50.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 要拍喽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.35,0:10:07.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下 那边的那个 好恶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.78,0:10:09.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真厉害 真厉害 美美大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.09,0:10:11.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我太感动了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.37,0:10:11.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.21,0:10:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专业 你是专业的 超级专业
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.91,0:10:17.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是说了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.62,0:10:19.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美 是你的朋友嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:22.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大婶靠边站 这位是我的男朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:23.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没那回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:27.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:30.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 本来预定两个人拍的那场 就请你的朋友帮个忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.15,0:10:33.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天要来的那个人临时来不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来试试看吧 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.11,0:10:37.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 模特 我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:38.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.24,0:10:45.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题的 你个子这么高 时尚感也不错 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.69,0:10:49.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行不行不行不行不行 不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:51.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么能当模特
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:52.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没这回事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.92,0:10:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.19,0:10:55.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:56.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请做成咖喱的颜色
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.00,0:10:57.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.71,0:11:01.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会让你更加可爱哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:04.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可爱 绝对不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.47,0:11:06.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 交给我好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.37,0:11:09.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.68,0:11:13.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得那个人好有型哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:24.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:26.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.20,0:11:29.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不行 冻死了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:31.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好棒哦 跟我预想的一样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.99,0:11:33.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要说了 好丢人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.32,0:11:35.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的好可爱 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.03,0:11:36.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.10,0:11:39.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗 真的可爱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.07,0:11:41.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:43.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.44,0:11:44.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了 你转过去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.98,0:11:45.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好过分
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:47.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 做准备了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.48,0:11:49.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.97,0:12:00.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…旁边的女孩 能多笑一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.71,0:12:02.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:02.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:06.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.18,0:12:06.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.93,0:12:10.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我果然做不了模特啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.22,0:12:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然做不了 不过这样看着感觉挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.35,0:12:21.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.86,0:12:23.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很可爱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.53,0:12:23.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:27.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别搞措了 这都是造型师的功劳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:31.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美美好喜欢中原小姐给我挑的衣服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:32.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,造型师？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.96,0:12:35.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘴真甜呀 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.39,0:12:39.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的啦 跟中原小姐一起工作感觉真棒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.31,0:12:40.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又来了又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.87,0:12:48.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.16,0:12:49.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.30,0:12:53.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到想做的事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.99,0:12:55.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 你不会是想做模特吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.51,0:12:59.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能 你在镜头前超僵硬的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.95,0:13:03.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然确实蛮可爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.16,0:13:03.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.01,0:13:05.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 一点点啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:08.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 不过你放心啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.53,0:13:10.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想做的是造型师
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.93,0:13:14.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,造型师啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.48,0:13:18.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能不行吧 可我挺喜欢给模特挑衣服的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:23.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白痴 不是行不行的问题 而是你想不想做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.01,0:13:24.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想做
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.83,0:13:27.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就拿出自信去吧 你不是很有毅力的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.46,0:13:28.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:31.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 大谷老师向你保证
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.19,0:13:34.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷老师
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:37.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难受 放手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:38.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷老师还真温柔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.44,0:13:45.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过在那之前 问题是他成不成得了老师
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.89,0:13:46.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.19,0:13:47.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:49.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿遥 MAITY老师
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.29,0:13:51.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便兜风就兜到这了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.85,0:13:52.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.39,0:13:53.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:54.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:57.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是理莎的爱人 这位是我的外遇情人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.83,0:13:59.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.85,0:14:00.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小堀 别被他们给耍了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.23,0:14:02.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚都是骗我的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.01,0:14:04.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.01,0:14:08.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷有跟你联络了吗 今天是放榜日了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.50,0:14:09.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没 还没有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.65,0:14:11.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 刚刚看到那个小矮人了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.00,0:14:12.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:13.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,车站前的长椅
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.80,0:14:19.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样子坐着 喊他小矮人也不甩我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.66,0:14:21.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙肯定落榜了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.28,0:14:24.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样就太可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.54,0:14:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 工作怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.01,0:14:31.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厨房的小个子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.45,0:14:34.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,初次见面 我是理莎的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.50,0:14:35.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.71,0:14:36.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好年轻啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.28,0:14:37.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.49,0:14:40.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 大谷有跟你联络吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.19,0:14:41.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,（又耍我啊）
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.21,0:14:42.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没 怎么这么问
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.79,0:14:44.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打了很多电话都没接
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.74,0:14:45.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.39,0:14:48.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,百分之百落榜了 果然是个白痴啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.75,0:14:50.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸灾乐祸会遭天谴的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:53.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是保荐合格生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.80,0:14:54.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:08.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您所拨打的电话暂时无法接通 请在提示音后留言
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.31,0:15:10.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结束留言请按#号
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.18,0:15:14.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定落榜了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.97,0:15:21.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又怎么了 不是说过不要发出怪声的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.17,0:15:23.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 我请求早退
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.05,0:15:26.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧急事件 拜托您了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.60,0:15:27.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.09,0:15:31.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,松原小姐 我会把小泉的那份做完的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.09,0:15:32.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小堀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:33.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.33,0:15:34.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:36.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下 小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.32,0:15:40.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很对不起 这个月不发薪水也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:46.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 我也有过这种岁月呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.37,0:15:48.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不会被耍了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.95,0:15:56.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的大谷 今年不行的话 还有明年呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.50,0:16:00.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算再学一年还不行 我一辈子都会支持你的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.49,0:16:03.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以…所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.18,0:16:21.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 你在哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.73,0:16:23.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逃避的是笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:43.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行大谷 你不能死
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.69,0:16:45.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了有什么好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.74,0:16:47.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁说要死了 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.74,0:16:48.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.42,0:16:50.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明年再考一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.19,0:16:54.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明明考上了 干嘛还要再考一次
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:55.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都说了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.83,0:16:58.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说什么说 我都说我考上了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.13,0:17:02.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骗人 怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.60,0:17:04.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:07.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是你不是坐在车站前的长椅上垂头丧气的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.94,0:17:09.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 那时放下心来我就睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.15,0:17:11.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电话也不接
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.44,0:17:16.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手机在充电 本想醒来后就想去小泉那的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.58,0:17:25.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 原来考上了啊 考上了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:27.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:28.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么怎么了 白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.41,0:17:33.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一下子睡觉 手机又充电 让人家多担心知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.16,0:17:35.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也没办法 你打工的时候又不能打电话进去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.60,0:17:36.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话虽如此
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.36,0:17:42.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 好不容易考上了 却听到‘骗人 怎么会’之类的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.50,0:17:43.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也说点别的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:47.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我太担心了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.72,0:17:52.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:57.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉 怎么样也不用在这里哭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.62,0:17:59.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是人家高兴嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:02.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:03.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.01,0:18:08.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有小泉你 我是绝对不可能那么努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.05,0:18:12.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我能考上都是小泉你的功劳
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.73,0:18:14.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚在这里就这么想的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:15.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:17.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个让人操心的家伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.10,0:18:25.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大谷 恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.82,0:18:27.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.03,0:18:40.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家各自决定了人生的前进道路 马上就要分开了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.73,0:18:50.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能 最后 到最后了居然还迟到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.98,0:18:56.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你连毕业典礼都迟到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.87,0:18:57.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.99,0:18:59.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也对哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.43,0:19:00.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么啊 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.98,0:19:03.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这句话我原封不动还给你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.21,0:19:04.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再还你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:05.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准还
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:07.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了吗 笨蛋二人组
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.65,0:19:09.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.35,0:19:14.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来真的要在毕业证书上写上你们ALL阪神巨人的大名
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.30,0:19:15.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.44,0:19:16.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别学我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:18.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们忘了自己迟到的事情了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.74,0:19:20.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.27,0:19:25.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧 注意脚下
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.48,0:19:27.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:30.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贫血 可她是学生代表呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.86,0:19:32.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还真糟糕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.56,0:19:39.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以上 是在校生代表的发言
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:39.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 那对白痴又迟到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.98,0:19:42.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来 有请毕业生代表讲话
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.83,0:19:42.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕业典礼都快结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.17,0:19:44.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕业生代表
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.28,0:19:51.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕业生代表大谷敦士 小泉理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.48,0:19:59.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 好长 这些全部都要读吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.66,0:20:01.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白痴 你在对着话筒说话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.82,0:20:02.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.74,0:20:03.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骗你干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.77,0:20:04.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那大谷拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.91,0:20:05.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一人一半
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:07.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我先读了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.34,0:20:08.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:10.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在读什么啊 给我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.74,0:20:11.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:13.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我住手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.59,0:20:16.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么 这样怎么读啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.25,0:20:17.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你的错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.40,0:20:22.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安静 安静
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.01,0:20:29.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老师们 这三年来真的麻烦你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.60,0:20:32.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托你们的福 大家都长大了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.48,0:20:33.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉本来就很大只
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.53,0:20:37.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是啊 也有原来就这么小的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.24,0:20:37.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙 我要揍人了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.50,0:20:44.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 在舞户学园里充满着我们快乐的回忆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.49,0:20:48.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也有很多美妙的相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.28,0:20:53.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 这些 在今天都要分开了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.28,0:20:59.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有要去远方的人 也有即将分离的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.12,0:21:01.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.05,0:21:06.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想到这里 我就…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.40,0:21:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙 哭什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.70,0:21:16.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:18.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.37,0:21:22.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 最后让我们高呼万岁三次来结束吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:23.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:26.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有搞笑二人组怎么行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.93,0:21:27.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:30.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.88,0:21:35.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万岁 万岁 万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.13,0:21:48.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能和大谷相遇 真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.64,0:21:49.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最喜欢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.64,0:21:54.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是 有小泉在身边太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:22:00.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今后 也要永远在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.88,0:23:24.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,ByeBye 再见了~
